# enforcement-map-sites and its shard drivers (b, c, which exec the parent's run.sh --group) share ONE declaration.
# seed.sh copies core/, scripts/, .githooks/ and templates/ whole and mutates the copies; the decoy root also takes VERSION.
# The validator under test, REQUIRED: the sentinel prints where run.sh passes its distribution-only guard.
!scripts/validate-enforcement-map.sh
scripts/
.githooks/
templates/
core/
VERSION
